            <p>We are an established world force in the design and manufacture of instrumentation for industrial process control, flow measurement, gas and liquid analysis and environmental applications.</p>
            <p>As a part of ABB, a world leader in process automation technology, we offer customers application expertise, service and support worldwide.</p>
            <p>We are committed to teamwork, high quality manufacturing, advanced technology and unrivalled service and support.</p>
