            </div>
            <div style="text-align: center;">
                <img src="placeholder_mounting_2.png" alt="Traditional Barrel Housing vertical mounting" style="max-width: 45%; height: auto;">
                <p style="font-size: 0.9em;">Traditional (Barrel) Housing vertical mounting with bracket for vertical or horizontal pipe (option B1 and B2).</p>
            </div>
        </div>
